			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 8 components\n\nSynchronize all 8 submodules with the following changes:\n- **Cocoon:** Bump @vitest/coverage-v8 from v4.1.4 to v4.1.5 in extension host dependency\n- **Common:** Update @cloudflare/workers-types from 4.20260421.1 to 4.20260422.1 for improved type coverage\n- **Grove:** Bump Rust dependencies — wasmtime 42→44, wasmtime-wasi 42→44, wasmparser 0.245→0.247, prost 0.12→0.14, tonic 0.12→0.14, tonic-build 0.12→0.14, vergen 8→9\n- **Mountain:** Submodule updated (no additional commits)\n- **Output:** Remove compiled JavaScript artifacts (.js/.js.map) from Configuration directory, leaving only TypeScript sources\n- **Rest:** Update rayon from 1.11.0 to 1.12.0 for upstream performance improvements\n- **SideCar:** Bump tauri-plugin-shell from 2.0 to 2.3 for Tauri 2.x shell API support\n- **Sky:** Upgrade Astro from 6.1.8 to 6.1.9 and @astrojs/compiler-rs from 0.1.7 to 0.1.8\n\nThis coordinated update delivers dependency updates, build cleanup, and compatibility improvements across the monorepo while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
